      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{66fd9cb60d32516d3718cc23|full_name} I mean specifically Visitor and maybe New User, because I see a LOT of desktop trolls on Visitor rank that bombard an instance and say obscene things \n\nand the bias wouldnt have to be very big either",
